---
import Layout from '../../layouts/PresentationLayout.astro';
import Comparison from '../../components/presentation/ConceptComparison.astro';
---
<Layout title="Compare design directions"><section class="container comparison-page"><p class="eyebrow">A considered choice</p><h1>Different directions.<br />A clearer perspective.</h1><p>Explore the intended structure and character of each proposal. These are editorial design notes, not performance scores. Only Concept 01 currently has a working foundation.</p><Comparison /></section></Layout>
<style>.comparison-page { padding-block:60px; }.comparison-page h1 { font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,4.5rem); margin-block:25px; }.comparison-page > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width:700px; }</style>
